diff --git a/unreleased_changes/10265.md b/unreleased_changes/10265.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..b0c240e00b4
--- /dev/null
+++ b/unreleased_changes/10265.md
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+### Changed
+- The `Connectome` tab in the right-hand side panel is now only shown if the dataset contains connectome files.
+- The `AbsTree` tab is no longer part of the default layout. Open it via **Show Abstract Tree** in the actions menu of the `Skeleton` tab. It can now be closed, which also removes it from previously saved layouts.
